### Scenario 30
### Async claim -> additional info -> tenant response -> penalty applied
### Notes:
### - assessment runs asynchronously in assessment-service
### - poll GET /api/claims/{id} after create and after additional-info

### 30.1 Login as landlord
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1
}

> {%
client.global.set("landlordToken", response.body.token);
%}

###

POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 3
}

> {%
client.global.set("tenantToken", response.body.token);
%}

###

POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 5
}

> {%
client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token);
%}

### 30.2 List seeded users
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 30.3 Create claim with amount >= 200 so first async assessment asks for additional info
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

{
  "tenantUserId": 3,
  "title": "Broken sofa and stained carpet",
  "description": "Tenant left visible damage and the claim requires asynchronous assessment.",
  "claimedAmount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

> {%
client.global.set("claimId30", response.body.id);
%}

### 30.4 Poll claim until status becomes NEED_ADDITIONAL_INFO
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId30}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 30.5 Send additional info and trigger reassessment
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId30}}/additional-info
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

{
  "comment": "Uploaded serial number and room overview separately; reassess please."
}

### 30.6 Poll claim until status becomes AWAITING_TENANT_RESPONSE
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId30}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 30.7 Tenant responds
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId30}}/tenant-response
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

{
  "agree": false,
  "comment": "I disagree with the final amount."
}

### 30.8 Admin requests penalty application
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId30}}/support-decision
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "applyPenalty": true,
  "penaltyAmount": 175.00,
  "penaltyCurrency": "USD",
  "note": "Proceed with penalty application",
  "simulateFailure": false
}

### 30.9 Poll claim until status becomes PENALTY_APPLIED
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId30}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 30.10 Inspect process status
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId30}}/process-status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 30.11 Inspect timeline
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId30}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 30.12 Inspect audit trail
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/audit/claims/{{claimId30}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
